{"unit_id":"xine2009cn__dsh-branch-inbox-guard#card-zh","repo":"xine2009cn/dsh-branch-inbox-guard","commit":"a5ab75460badb89d7bebda60edfae6310627f42a","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-branch-inbox-guard 是一个面向 DSH Web 客户端的宿主插件，在 agent/created 事件触发时检查会话收件箱，并根据 session.inheritedEventCount 与事件日志找出从 fork 父会话继承的待执行提问。它会清空全为继承项的队列，或逐项移除继承项，同时保留分支自己加入以及无法追溯来源的内容；清理通过收件箱取消操作记录。适合从会话分支后希望优先执行新问题、或清理已有分支遗留队列的用户。安装后需重启 DSH，不需要额外密钥或账号。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:63-105","cordis.patch.yml:1-6"]}
{"unit_id":"xine2009cn__dsh-branch-inbox-guard#card-en","repo":"xine2009cn/dsh-branch-inbox-guard","commit":"a5ab75460badb89d7bebda60edfae6310627f42a","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-branch-inbox-guard checks the inbox when a DSH agent starts. It removes prompts traced to a fork parent's inherited event prefix, preserving branch-owned or untraceable items. This helps new branches run their own questions first. Restart DSH after installation; no API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:63-105","cordis.patch.yml:1-6"]}
