{"unit_id":"xine2009cn__dsh-branch-inbox-guard#feature-1","repo":"xine2009cn/dsh-branch-inbox-guard","commit":"a5ab75460badb89d7bebda60edfae6310627f42a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-branch-inbox-guard 的功能「清理继承提问」：智能体创建时检查待执行队列，按插入事件是否位于继承前缀内识别父会话遗留项，并清除整队继承项或逐条移除。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:63-89"]}
